{"w":2400,"lines":[{"h":0.017391367672705993,"x":0.084630658004751502,"y":0.058891525446700066,"w":0.10582518895467122,"c":1,"t":"Audioscripts"},{"t":"WOMAN:","x":0.084775085711614601,"y":0.10901162775172124,"w":0.053633219401041682,"h":0.0087209305119230196,"c":1},{"t":"MAN:","x":0.08650518986742313,"h":0.0087209305119231306,"y":0.14098837192911595,"w":0.031141869227091473,"c":1},{"y":0.15697674398104855,"t":"WOMAN:","h":0.011627907349230693,"c":1,"w":0.053633219401041668,"x":0.08477508571470406},{"h":0.010174418263205087,"y":0.17296511642153056,"w":0.032871971130371089,"c":1,"t":"MAN:","x":0.086505190814091651},{"w":0.053729368845621753,"h":0.01053766206563822,"t":"WOMAN:","y":0.20476023871709903,"x":0.084727010995463134,"c":1},{"x":0.086505190814091651,"y":0.22093023239423226,"w":0.032871971130371089,"h":0.0087209305119231306,"c":1,"t":"MAN:"},{"c":1,"h":0.011627907349230804,"w":0.053633219401041668,"t":"WOMAN:","x":0.084775085573150152,"y":0.25145348813299562},{"t":"MAN:","w":0.034602076212565114,"c":1,"y":0.28343023225561714,"h":0.011627907349230804,"x":0.084775086495793572},{"x":0.082999478289791193,"w":0.055454330444335939,"y":0.33121794921806935,"h":0.010529217810126945,"c":1,"t":"WOMAN:"},{"y":0.34738372107269333,"x":0.084775086374686309,"t":"MAN:","w":0.0346020762125651,"h":0.010174418263205087,"c":1},{"w":0.51730102539062506,"h":0.016095171448565426,"c":1,"y":0.1060181945526667,"t":"Great. The other thing I should tell you is that we provide wetsuits and life","x":0.1678200755074207},{"w":0.49307957967122396,"t":"jackets but you need to bring swimming trunks and some old trainers.","x":0.16435986406161543,"h":0.016115514276076048,"y":0.12209302332995464,"c":1},{"t":"And a towel?","y":0.13772022081539315,"h":0.015257232751439198,"w":0.095308551788330087,"c":1,"x":0.16774364792027419},{"w":0.56228373209635418,"x":0.16608996776643417,"t":"Yes definitely. And you might want to bring your own toiletries, things like shampoo.","y":0.15395381366685279,"h":0.016104325787682394,"c":1},{"h":0.016095171448565426,"t":"OK. What about food and drink? Do I need to bring that or is there a café at the","x":0.16782006014052001,"y":0.17004898527083834,"w":0.55882354736328133,"c":1},{"w":0.56055363972981775,"y":0.20188943344687615,"x":0.16782006585981235,"h":0.01613382228693816,"t":"Yes, you can get sandwiches, cakes and snacks there. The food's pretty reasonable.","c":1},{"h":0.016095171448565537,"y":0.21798460438330425,"x":0.16782006014134651,"t":"OK good. Well I think I'm interested in the Level 1 course. But I know absolutely","w":0.55882354736328121,"c":1},{"w":0.51742823282877604,"t":"nothing about sailing so is there anything I can do to prepare myself a bit?","x":0.16776624570658716,"h":0.017640510916793306,"c":1,"y":0.23238213325585877},{"t":"I recommend you watch some videos we use for training. They're available","y":0.25000000007435164,"c":1,"h":0.015988371937820656,"x":0.16608995767144905,"w":0.52076126098632813},{"x":0.16774946514825245,"w":0.51222920735677091,"h":0.017978213065316107,"c":1,"y":0.26385679792317629,"t":"online. I can send you the link. They'll give you an idea of what to expect."},{"c":1,"x":0.16782008179313085,"y":0.28052325588883575,"t":"Perfect, thanks. That would be very helpful. Oh and just one other thing - I'II","h":0.015988371937820434,"w":0.53460205078125012},{"w":0.50865051269531258,"h":0.016138908327501866,"c":1,"y":0.29636109159176183,"t":"be cycling to the club and will need somewhere to put valuables. I'm just","x":0.16782007229065024},{"x":0.16782006996237228,"h":0.016095171448565426,"w":0.342560551961263,"c":1,"t":"wondering if there are lockers for people to use?","y":0.31245626319417397},{"t":"Yes, there are plenty in the changing rooms.","y":0.32848837216483173,"w":0.31141868591308591,"h":0.01615823408037409,"c":1,"x":0.16608996489035538},{"h":0.014534884186538477,"w":0.2941176350911458,"x":0.1695501788750976,"t":"Great. OK well could you book me onto...","y":0.34447674394728556,"c":1},{"y":0.39499588366933813,"x":0.084684442764622878,"c":1,"t":"PART 2","w":0.086686477661132813,"h":0.016694279130811451},{"y":0.42732558153929712,"t":"MAN:","w":0.034602076212565114,"x":0.08477508637013341,"h":0.010174418263205087,"c":1},{"t":"WOMAN:","y":0.49832103189840538,"w":0.052007986704508471,"x":0.086452753962686771,"h":0.0091718896608239397,"c":1},{"x":0.16955018560395785,"w":0.53460205078125,"c":1,"h":0.016099239747118799,"t":"Hello and welcome to the film making podcast. In this week's episode, Claire","y":0.42441860472577009},{"h":0.013081395100512871,"t":"Lemarre talks to us about how to become a makeup artist. Claire's been","y":0.44040697686550434,"x":0.16955017293403032,"w":0.5,"c":1},{"y":0.45491724202124284,"w":0.55027847290039067,"x":0.16777345662201809,"t":"working as a makeup artist in the film industry for over 20 years and has lots of","h":0.017629018774226068,"c":1},{"x":0.16955017257797683,"w":0.27681660970052085,"y":0.47235829218171443,"c":1,"h":0.013106823968586978,"t":"useful advice about how to get started."},{"c":1,"w":0.54152247111002594,"x":0.16955018306162478,"y":0.49563953464755228,"h":0.014534884186538477,"t":"Thanks lan. Well, before you can become a makeup artist on films you have to"},{"c":1,"w":0.3546712748209635,"t":"spend about 2 years working as a makeup trainee.","x":0.16782007184662215,"h":0.016095171448565426,"y":0.51154653573945807},{"w":0.49826990763346357,"h":0.015988371937820545,"y":0.53488372100307546,"c":1,"t":"A good place to get your first job would be on a low budget short film.","x":0.167820063445173},{"h":0.018870718751110571,"c":1,"t":"Of course, this means that you'll be working for free. But it's often worth it for","y":0.54978413088711775,"x":0.16947275789999347,"w":0.54168202718098957},{"w":0.53819341023763023,"y":0.56510105623508,"c":1,"t":"the experience. Make sure your transport costs are covered - and remember,","h":0.017771318461029084,"x":0.16949581610698242},{"c":1,"y":0.58284883727982917,"h":0.015988371937820545,"t":"there's very unlikely to be any catering provided, so bring plenty of food.","x":0.16782007814014149,"w":0.5103806050618489},{"c":1,"w":0.52953562418619793,"x":0.1677575201044785,"t":"If you're lucky, you might start out on a big budget film where you'll get the","h":0.018445420048301964,"y":0.60548555196582798},{"t":"most useful experience. On productions like this, makeup and hair styling are","w":0.53806228637695308,"c":1,"y":0.62209302326074101,"h":0.016115514276076048,"x":0.16782006929186311},{"w":0.52595153808593753,"x":0.16782007836187554,"t":"separate departments - so you won't need to bring your curling tongs! But","c":1,"y":0.63808139522658391,"h":0.015988371937820545},{"w":0.55363321940104171,"h":0.01610432512031057,"y":0.65395381417708809,"c":1,"x":0.16782007106072483,"t":"you're likely to get the opportunity to work with a range of age groups, as well"},{"t":"as different ethnicities. Doing makeup for special effects is highly specialised, so","x":0.16782006014308612,"w":0.55882354736328121,"y":0.67004898527060197,"c":1,"h":0.016095171448565426},{"w":0.41522491455078125,"c":1,"y":0.6860465117017196,"t":"don't expect to be offered any practical experience in that.","h":0.015988371937820545,"x":0.16782006859089119},{"w":0.46020762125651038,"t":"One problem with working in the makeup department is that it's a","x":0.16955016757243688,"h":0.016095171448565426,"y":0.70923722867805683,"c":1},{"t":"high-pressure environment. There are very few times when you'll be bored or","y":0.72471188345825921,"c":1,"x":0.16776723951090047,"h":0.018102362241004255,"w":0.54164057413736988},{"t":"have nothing to do. It can be stressful but you'll see that the top makeup artists","x":0.16955017793665084,"y":0.74273255826157336,"w":0.55536331176757814,"h":0.013081395100512871,"c":1},{"w":0.55722193400065101,"y":0.75677593786895092,"x":0.16775420412144854,"t":"are very protessional - even when they're having to work with directors who are","h":0.017876260008655165,"c":1},{"h":0.016107377011597479,"c":1,"t":"impatient, or unhappy with the makeup artist's work. Follow your supervisor's","y":0.77325581402258525,"x":0.16608997562716327,"w":0.54152247111002594},{"y":0.7892441862388313,"x":0.16955018117523712,"h":0.014534882851794828,"t":"lead and try to remain calm at all times.","w":0.27854670206705723,"c":1},{"x":0.1677684036578099,"y":0.81231026252307181,"c":1,"w":0.52604624430338542,"h":0.017327827202681445,"t":"I've worked with many very famous actors over the years. At first, I found it"},{"y":0.82848837197077008,"t":"overwhelming and could hardly speak, I was so in awe. That's preferable, by the","w":0.55709340413411457,"h":0.01615823408037409,"x":0.16782008430837511,"c":1},{"y":0.84447674437836617,"c":1,"w":0.53633214314778654,"x":0.16955019370869034,"h":0.014534882851794828,"t":"way, to becoming too excited and asking for selfies. Now meeting the talent"},{"w":0.52941177368164061,"y":0.86039188266454558,"h":0.01469559132260323,"t":"is just a normal part of the job and to be honest most actors don't look that","c":1,"x":0.16782006466252228},{"c":1,"t":"special without all the makeup!","x":0.16782007076680547,"y":0.87788663367674635,"h":0.01469559132260323,"w":0.21972318013509115},{"y":0.90116279046248748,"c":1,"w":0.55882354736328121,"t":"Every makeup trainee will need a makeup kit, which they'l be expected to have","h":0.014534884186538477,"x":0.16955016394357927},{"y":0.91707487728554216,"c":1,"x":0.16782005699141195,"w":0.55017303466796874,"t":"with them at all times. Just the essentials will do for the kinds of tasks you'll be","h":0.01469559132260323},{"h":0.016125685689831415,"t":"given - it won't be anything complicated. It's worth looking at what the other","w":0.54152247111002605,"x":0.16782007927272521,"c":1,"y":0.93313953495747903},{"y":0.95784883727895875,"x":0.086505190665942658,"t":"98","h":0.01308139510051276,"c":1,"w":0.022491348584493004},{"y":0.13808139542268638,"c":1,"x":0.74913494782729007,"w":0.024221453666686932,"h":0.01308139510051276,"t":"Q7"},{"h":0.011627907349230804,"c":1,"x":0.74913494782729007,"y":0.17005813930391767,"w":0.024221453666686932,"t":"Q8"},{"t":"Q9","x":0.74913494782729007,"h":0.011627907349230804,"y":0.24999999976903398,"w":0.024221453666686932,"c":1},{"w":0.034602076212565058,"t":"Q10","x":0.7491349479663818,"y":0.31250000008782497,"h":0.01308139510051276,"c":1},{"w":0.031141869227091501,"t":"Q11","h":0.013081395100512871,"c":1,"x":0.7508650513034093,"y":0.56686046510962729},{"t":"Q12","x":0.7508650524153988,"y":0.63953488380875523,"h":0.013081395100512871,"c":1,"w":0.032871971130371103},{"t":"Q13","h":0.01308139510051276,"c":1,"y":0.75726744194374807,"w":0.032871971130371103,"x":0.75086505241599955},{"w":0.032871971130371103,"c":1,"t":"Q14","h":0.01308139510051276,"x":0.75086505241059298,"y":0.81395348845778059}],"h":2857}